instrument wingie
; color-wingie — the Wingie listening. Its microphones hear the room: every attack steps a
; sequence (as its own threshold sequencer does), whatever sings is followed by a second voice.
; fader1 (Mix) how easily it hears, fader2 (Decay) how worn the tape is

under the highway
-----------------
; a truck thumps the deck: the bass line takes a step and the Chloe's gate is struck.
; Something hums in the concrete: a sine follows it an octave down
the ear is onset sensitivity=0.6
the singer is pitchtrack
the phrase is seq 8: 0 3 7 10 12 7 3 -2
the bass is vco 1
the room is chloe mode=low drive=0.5 cutoff=0.35 resonance=0.6
the shadow is sine 1 tune=-1
the hush is lpg
the cassette is tape age=0.4
the wall is limiter ceiling=0.8

mic.both -> ear singer
ear.pulse -> phrase.next room.gate
phrase -> bass.pitch
bass.saw -> room
singer.pitch -> shadow.pitch
singer.gate => hush.level
shadow -25> hush
room hush -> cassette -> wall -> out
fader1 -> ear.sensitivity
fader2 -> cassette.age
ear.env -> lights.left
singer.confidence -> lights.right

the shortwave confession
------------------------
; what the microphones hear goes out over a dying radio; how hard each attack is turns the dial.
; Each attack slices the broadcast into a dub skank
the ear is onset sensitivity=0.5
the set is radio drift=0.5
the dial is slew
the cut is slicer pattern=offbeat len=0.6
the echo is tapeecho 4
the wall is limiter ceiling=0.8

mic.both -> ear set
ear.strength -> dial
40 -> set.tune
dial -20> set.tune               ; 0.4 to 0.6: wobbling across the station
ear.pulse -> cut.clock
set -> cut -> echo -> wall -> out
cut -40> wall
fader1 -> ear.sensitivity
fader2 -> echo.feedback
ear.env -> lights.left
ear.pulse -> lights.right
